**t0-even-odd**: count evens and odds, handle negatives with % — sign follows dividend, but n % 2 == 0 works for negatives too.

```
troufu even = 0;
troufu odd = 0;
troufu line = bounfou();
tafashou line ~= furfifan
    troufu n = shufa(line);
    sitrartu n % 2 == 0 fisu drufirsa
        even = even + 1;
    drumin tru drufirsa
        odd = odd + 1;
    drumin
    line = bounfou();
trushou
binmi "even " + even;
binmi "odd " + odd;
```

**t0-factorial**: n ≤ 20, factorial fits in 64-bit (20! = 2432902008176640000 < 2^63-1 ≈ 9.22e18). Loop.

```
troufu n = shufa(bounfou());
troufu result = 1;
sutrarsu i = 1 sou n
    result = result * i;
moun i
binmi result;
```

**t0-fizzbuzz**:

```
