    drumin tru sitrartu i % 3 == 0 fisu drufirsa
        binmi "Fizz";
    drumin tru sitrouta i % 5 == 0 fisu drufirsa
```

Careful: `drumin tru sitrartu` — the else-if chain. Write:

```
