    binmi "Fizz";
drumin tru sitrartu i % 5 == 0 fisu drufirsa
    binmi "Buzz";
drumin tru drufirsa
    binmi i;
drumin
```

Note: conditions must be booleans — `i % 15 == 0` is boolean, fine.

